      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i'm just overthinking this but it's happening so much lately. whenever i get really stressed or even just super angry at work, the lights in my cubicle will literally flicker or my monitor will glitch out. like, right when the emotion hits. has anyone else ever experienced like... projecting kinetic energy through their nervous system or something? it feels like my emotions are physically hitting the electronics.",
