      "content": "i get what you're saying about the science part, i know it sounds crazy. but it's not random. it literally only happens when i'm feeling something intense. like yesterday i was so frustrated with a project that the whole overhead light started buzzing and dimming right in front of me. it felt like a pulse. i feel like i need to learn how to control it or stabilize my aura or something so i don't keep causing disruptions at the office. can you suggest some ways to manage this energy so it doesnt leak out?",
